## Open edges

```
- AI provider choice           Mistral (matches existing experience) vs OpenAI-compat (broader tooling)
- LiteLLM gateway              from start vs add when 2+ providers needed
- OCR                          skip entirely in this slice · defer to slice-4
- worker queue                 BackgroundTasks throughout vs Celery from start
- evaluation harness           build alongside this slice or push to slice-4
- repo restructure timing      do it as first step of this slice or just before
```

